OL,3,GNEWSAUK-first heart implant keeps rugby
OL,4,Adream alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has become the first
OL,7,Fperson in the UK to have a dissolvable
OL,8,Fimplant fitted to close a hole in her
OL,9,Fheart that is around the size of a 10p
OL,10,Fpiece.
OL,12,FLillie Yale, from Warrington, faced
OL,13,Fhaving a permanent metal device, which
OL,14,Fwould have hindered her dream of
OL,15,Fbecoming a professional rugby player.
OL,17,FHowever, the biodegradable implant will
OL,18,Fact as a scaffold for Lillie's heart to
OL,19,Fheal itself over the coming months and
OL,20,Fyears, before fully dissolving and
OL,21,Fleaving behind no trace.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
